sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant API as Backend
  B->>API: POST /v1/chat {"message": "What projects have you built?"}
  API-->>B: 200 text/event-stream
  API-->>B: event: session (id kept in memory)
  API-->>B: event: queued (position 1)
  API-->>B: event: started
  API-->>B: event: text (first checked sentence)
  API-->>B: event: text (second checked sentence)
  API-->>B: event: sources
  API-->>B: event: done (complete)
